### Running VCS Simulation

```bash
# Compile VCS simulation
make simv

# Run test case (default is dhrystone.bin)
make run

# Run specific test case
make run RUN_BIN=hello.bin
```

### Running Verilator Simulation

```bash
# Compile Verilator simulation
make emu

# Run test case
make emu-run
```
- DUMP=1: dump waveforms
- DIFF=0: disable NEMU difftest

### Running Xcelium Simulation

```bash

# Compile Xcelium simulation
make xsim

# Run test case
make xrun
